<title>POLAND: Pekpol Q1 net falls to PLN 0.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Pekpol Q1 net falls to PLN 0.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pekpol preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.14 vs	0.29</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.44 vs	1.47</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.24 vs	1.29</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Pekpol SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 45.32 vs     48.07</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  45.26 vs     47.67</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.19 vs	0.18</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.02 vs	1.65</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.73 vs	0.47</p>
<p>    investment				 1.01 vs	0.43</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
